@baseUrl = {{$processEnv AETHER_MANAGER_TEST_URL}}
@csrf = copy-from-session-response
@accountId = copy-from-account-response
@sessionId = copy-from-session-response
@graphDeviceId = copy-from-Intune-device-response
@graphDeploymentId = copy-from-Autopatch-deployment-response

### One-time bootstrap: HTTPS administrative tool only, not a browser. Never save credentials in this file.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/bootstrap
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv AETHER_ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"initial-admin","password":"{{$processEnv AETHER_ACCOUNT_PASSWORD}}","role":"Administrator"}

### HTTPS login; HTTP client must retain the secure cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-Aether-Login: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"initial-admin","password":"{{$processEnv AETHER_ACCOUNT_PASSWORD}}"}

### Current identity / absolute expiry / CSRF token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/session

### Fleet, actual observations and server sample
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/fleet

### Users (Administrator only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts

### User metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}

### Create Reader; only run intentionally against an isolated test server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-Aether-CSRF: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"test-reader","password":"{{$processEnv AETHER_READER_PASSWORD}}","role":"Reader"}

### Change role / disable / optional password reset; revokes all sessions; last admin safeguarded
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-Aether-CSRF: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"Reader","disabled":false}

### Active session metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/sessions

### Explicit session revocation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/sessions/{{sessionId}}/revoke
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-Aether-CSRF: {{csrf}}

### Account security audit (readable by signed-in roles)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/account-audit

### Microsoft Graph local configuration status; does not request a Graph token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cloud/status

### Intune inventory; explicitly contacts the configured Microsoft tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cloud/devices

### Autopatch inventory; uses the Graph beta API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cloud/deployments

### CONFIRMATION REQUIRED: request one Intune synchronization in a test tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cloud/devices/{{graphDeviceId}}/sync
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-Aether-CSRF: {{csrf}}

### CONFIRMATION REQUIRED: pause one existing Autopatch deployment in a test tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cloud/deployments/{{graphDeploymentId}}/state
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-Aether-CSRF: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"paused":true}

### CONFIRMATION REQUIRED: resume one existing Autopatch deployment in a test tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cloud/deployments/{{graphDeploymentId}}/state
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-Aether-CSRF: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"paused":false}

### CSRF failure: expect Problem Details 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/enrollment-codes
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-Aether-CSRF: invalid

### Logout revokes the current server-side session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-Aether-CSRF: {{csrf}}
